WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:18.050
[ Watch on KissFlix.co ]

2
00:18.320 --> 00:20.120
The darkness of 1997

3
00:21.070 --> 00:22.640
seemed especially long.

4
00:24.190 --> 00:25.160
I was trapped in this

5
00:25.160 --> 00:26.600
long night

6
00:26.710 --> 00:28.510
for a very, very long time.

7
00:29.510 --> 00:30.440
I know

8
00:31.280 --> 00:33.110
someone blocked the light

9
00:34.030 --> 00:36.240
and buried the truth in the dark.

10
00:38.460 --> 00:39.590
Since then,

11
00:40.710 --> 00:42.390
I've had only one thought:

12
00:43.880 --> 00:44.790
to light

13
00:44.790 --> 00:46.720
this suffocating darkness ablaze

14
00:47.350 --> 00:48.880
with my own hands.

15
02:14.390 --> 02:19.270
[LIGHT THE DARK]

16
02:20.240 --> 02:22.810
[Episode 1]

17
02:26.120 --> 02:28.520
Safety first, prevention foremost.

18
02:27.740 --> 02:32.390
[Wugang Petrochemical Plant, Late Summer 1997]

19
02:28.590 --> 02:31.250
Everyone is responsible for workplace safety.

20
02:31.280 --> 02:33.120
No gas operation is too minor to take safety seriously.

21
02:32.390 --> 02:35.500
[Wugang Petrochemical Gas Distribution Plant]

22
02:33.240 --> 02:35.630
Unsafe practices can lead to disaster.

23
02:35.710 --> 02:38.800
All plant employees must strictly follow safety regulations

24
02:37.030 --> 02:41.700
[Wugang Chemical and Gas Construction Team]

25
02:38.910 --> 02:40.710
and operating procedures,

26
02:40.710 --> 02:42.870
stay alert at all times,

27
02:42.870 --> 02:45.240
and ensure safety at every stage of production.

28
02:45.240 --> 02:46.710
This rigorous approach

29
02:45.860 --> 02:52.240
[Improve Safety and Cut Costs; Boost Efficiency Through Technical Innovation]

30
02:46.710 --> 02:50.030
will help safeguard gas transmission and distribution.

31
02:55.590 --> 02:56.400
Ying.

32
02:57.520 --> 02:59.020
You've been using this trick on me

33
02:59.020 --> 03:00.080
since we were kids.

34
03:00.240 --> 03:01.030
So what?

35
03:01.190 --> 03:03.450
I can use this trick for another 20 years.

36
03:04.310 --> 03:05.900
[Engineer Employment Contract, Guangdong Petrochemical Plant]

37
03:07.520 --> 03:10.620
[Engineer Employment Contract, Guangdong Petrochemical Plant]

38
03:07.890 --> 03:10.080
This is the petrochemical plant with the most advanced equipment

39
03:10.080 --> 03:11.810
and best benefits in the south.

40
03:13.590 --> 03:15.380
I was the only person from the Petroleum University's

41
03:15.380 --> 03:17.980
chemical engineering department they hired.

42
03:18.870 --> 03:19.800
Are you really going

43
03:19.800 --> 03:21.280
to such a faraway place alone?

44
03:21.280 --> 03:22.120
Of course.

45
03:23.190 --> 03:25.800
We are the ones who shape the world.

46
03:26.240 --> 03:26.990
Ying.

47
03:27.079 --> 03:28.420
Mom and Dad have spent half their lives

48
03:28.420 --> 03:29.400
in the plant,

49
03:29.470 --> 03:31.079
as if the world consisted of nothing

50
03:31.079 --> 03:33.150
but the family quarters

51
03:33.180 --> 03:34.440
and the plant grounds.

52
03:34.960 --> 03:36.550
I have to go out and explore.

53
03:38.680 --> 03:40.880
Are you sure you've thought it through?

54
03:41.870 --> 03:43.070
What's wrong, Ying?

55
03:43.190 --> 03:44.790
Are you going to stop me, too?

56
03:48.000 --> 03:50.000
I know your ID was confiscated.

57
03:50.020 --> 03:50.730
I just got it

58
03:50.760 --> 03:52.960
from the filing cabinet in Mom's office

59
03:53.030 --> 03:54.190
for you.

60
03:53.450 --> 03:54.490
[Name: Chen Shan]

61
03:56.860 --> 03:57.740
[Name: Chen Shan]

62
03:59.400 --> 04:00.560
You got it?

63
03:59.560 --> 04:00.170
[Name: Chen Shan]

64
04:00.710 --> 04:01.960
I stole it. I stole it.

65
04:01.980 --> 04:02.860
Alright?

66
04:04.990 --> 04:07.470
[Advance the Plant Through Science and Technology; Boost Efficiency Through Reform]

67
04:07.430 --> 04:10.590
May everyone come to work happily

68
04:10.590 --> 04:12.590
and go home safely.

69
04:12.590 --> 04:13.240
Shan,

70
04:13.240 --> 04:14.030
come back!

71
04:21.950 --> 04:22.630
Dad.

72
04:23.950 --> 04:25.550
What's wrong with your neck?

73
04:26.240 --> 04:27.280
Stiff neck.

74
04:28.240 --> 04:29.020
Have you had breakfast?

75
04:29.020 --> 04:29.680
Yes.

76
04:31.020 --> 04:32.450
Ying's being transferred to a different position.

77
04:32.450 --> 04:33.800
What are you doing here causing trouble?

78
04:33.800 --> 04:34.920
Come with me.

79
04:35.120 --> 04:36.390
I'm not going to the construction site.

80
04:36.390 --> 04:37.720
Where else would you go?

81
04:37.920 --> 04:38.720
To heaven?

82
04:38.720 --> 04:40.490
I don't even work at this plant.

83
04:40.600 --> 04:41.590
You'll be assigned

84
04:41.590 --> 04:42.950
to the construction team soon.

85
04:42.950 --> 04:44.430
Come with me and get the lay of the land.

86
04:44.430 --> 04:45.120
Let's go.

87
04:45.390 --> 04:46.510
I haven't had breakfast yet.

88
04:46.510 --> 04:47.870
There's breakfast in the car.

89
04:47.870 --> 04:48.400
Let's go.

90
04:51.650 --> 04:56.610
[Construction Vehicle]

91
04:52.120 --> 04:53.120
Dad, take care.

92
04:53.120 --> 04:53.980
We're leaving.

93
05:13.630 --> 05:14.160
Come in.

94
05:20.750 --> 05:21.510
Mr. Qi.

95
05:24.600 --> 05:25.390
You're here.

96
05:26.390 --> 05:26.950
Well...

97
05:28.510 --> 05:30.170
Are you looking for my master?

98
05:30.240 --> 05:32.370
She went out and will be back in a while.

99
05:32.630 --> 05:33.560
This bed

100
05:33.560 --> 05:35.390
was wrecked by Shan.

101
05:35.409 --> 05:36.870
Why don't you get a new one?

102
05:37.560 --> 05:38.830
I can fix it up and keep using it.

103
05:38.830 --> 05:41.120
It was from my master, after all.

104
05:41.790 --> 05:42.500
By the way,

105
05:43.120 --> 05:43.840
Chen Ying,

106
05:44.000 --> 05:45.310
if you

107
05:45.310 --> 05:46.510
need anything fixed,

108
05:46.550 --> 05:47.409
just come to me.

109
05:47.680 --> 05:48.920
I can fix most everyday things.

110
05:48.920 --> 05:49.560
Okay.

111
05:50.480 --> 05:51.190
Master.

112
05:51.570 --> 05:52.180
Qi.

113
05:52.210 --> 05:52.840
Mom.

114
05:53.380 --> 05:54.640
If Ying needs anything to be fixed,

115
05:54.640 --> 05:55.560
she's got her dad.

116
05:55.560 --> 05:56.960
Why would she come to you?

117
05:58.040 --> 05:59.180
By the way, Qi,

118
05:59.240 --> 06:00.190
make sure you

119
06:00.210 --> 06:01.510
get those design plans finalized.

120
06:01.510 --> 06:01.870
Okay.

121
06:01.870 --> 06:02.730
Let's go, Ying.

122
06:08.430 --> 06:09.610
Goodbye, Mr. Qi.

123
06:15.430 --> 06:16.680
Come back again if you like it.

124
06:16.680 --> 06:17.280
Thank you.

125
06:18.560 --> 06:19.970
I'll have a serving of Liangxia.

126
06:19.970 --> 06:20.640
Mom.

127
06:21.070 --> 06:22.140
Don't just eat dry food.

128
06:22.140 --> 06:23.270
Have some Liangxia.

129
06:25.080 --> 06:26.450
Mom, what are you doing?

130
06:27.100 --> 06:28.820
I know my daughter is qualified,

131
06:28.820 --> 06:30.250
but sometimes you have to grease

132
06:30.250 --> 06:31.180
the right palms.

133
06:31.560 --> 06:33.159
Our plant is undergoing a major reform this year.

134
06:33.159 --> 06:35.040
Departments will be cut or merged.

135
06:35.040 --> 06:36.520
Administration isn't a core department.

136
06:36.520 --> 06:37.380
Who knows what will happen to it

137
06:37.380 --> 06:38.270
in the future?

138
06:38.430 --> 06:39.720
Everyone's after that accounting job

139
06:39.720 --> 06:41.180
in the Supply Department.

140
06:41.310 --> 06:42.810
I have to make sure

141
06:42.840 --> 06:43.970
nothing goes wrong.

142
06:45.870 --> 06:46.510
Mom.

143
06:48.310 --> 06:50.510
Then I'm not going to work here anymore.

144
06:51.310 --> 06:53.430
Don't put on that same fake moral high ground as your dad.

145
06:53.430 --> 06:55.190
You have to listen to me when it comes to work.

146
06:55.190 --> 06:56.870
-Mom. -Take it as my investment.

147
06:56.870 --> 06:59.000
I'm counting on you for my retirement.

148
06:59.360 --> 07:00.870
Hurry up. The director is waiting.

149
07:00.870 --> 07:01.480
Hurry.

150
07:01.480 --> 07:01.950
Mom.

151
07:02.190 --> 07:03.000
Listen to me.

152
07:08.290 --> 07:14.260
[Construction Vehicle]

153
07:08.560 --> 07:11.190
Those poor chickens and pigs!

154
07:11.190 --> 07:11.870
How dare you come back!

155
07:11.870 --> 07:13.000
How are we supposed to live?

156
07:13.000 --> 07:14.260
How dare you come back!

157
07:14.350 --> 07:15.580
How dare you come back, huh?

158
07:15.580 --> 07:16.640
What are you doing?

159
07:17.680 --> 07:18.920
What are you here for? How dare you come back!

160
07:18.920 --> 07:19.750
What are you here for?

161
07:19.750 --> 07:20.480
How dare you come back!

162
07:20.480 --> 07:21.190
What are you here for?

163
07:21.190 --> 07:21.950
Put everything down.

164
07:21.950 --> 07:23.000
Step back. Step back.

165
07:23.000 --> 07:23.660
Put it down!

166
07:24.190 --> 07:25.520
Do you want to go to jail?

167
07:27.510 --> 07:28.610
I am here today

168
07:28.630 --> 07:29.830
to solve this matter.

169
07:30.360 --> 07:31.420
If it's not solved,

170
07:31.510 --> 07:32.510
I won't leave.

171
07:37.680 --> 07:38.940
Look at this teahouse.

172
07:39.960 --> 07:41.710
It is considered Director Wan's

173
07:41.710 --> 07:42.909
second office.

174
07:43.700 --> 07:48.610
[Noble as the Pine Wind, Fragrant as the Orchid]

175
07:45.000 --> 07:45.800
Thank you.

176
07:47.070 --> 07:47.800
Wait.

177
07:50.810 --> 07:53.590
[Noble as the Pine Wind, Fragrant as the Orchid]

178
07:52.120 --> 07:52.680
Godfather.

179
07:52.680 --> 07:53.390
Ying.

180
07:53.870 --> 07:54.730
Senior Sister.

181
07:54.830 --> 07:57.430
I've already talked it over with Director Wan.

182
07:57.830 --> 07:58.680
Thank you, Junior Brother.

183
07:58.680 --> 08:00.240
Don't mention it. We're like family.

184
08:00.240 --> 08:01.160
Go on in.

185
08:00.800 --> 08:04.200
[Noble as the Pine Wind, Fragrant as the Orchid]

186
08:01.480 --> 08:02.070
Let's go.

187
08:02.870 --> 08:03.800
Go ahead.

188
08:07.360 --> 08:08.160
Come in.

189
08:10.510 --> 08:11.310
Wenying.

190
08:11.370 --> 08:12.570
Hello, Director Wan.

191
08:12.680 --> 08:13.890
Hello, Director Wan.

192
08:14.040 --> 08:14.940
-I brought the kid here. -Hello. Hello.

193
08:14.940 --> 08:15.860
Please sit.

194
08:16.230 --> 08:17.940
Deputy Director Geng told me

195
08:17.960 --> 08:19.720
you want her to be an accountant in the supply department.

196
08:19.720 --> 08:20.480
Yes.

197
08:20.770 --> 08:21.570
Director Wan.

198
08:21.630 --> 08:22.940
You must be tired

199
08:22.970 --> 08:24.460
of drinking tea all day.

200
08:24.720 --> 08:26.720
I picked up some ye'erba downstairs

201
08:27.090 --> 08:27.890
for you to try.

202
08:28.000 --> 08:29.310
You're too kind.

203
08:31.000 --> 08:32.080
Chen Ying, right?

204
08:34.730 --> 08:35.789
Hello, Director Wan.

205
08:35.789 --> 08:37.000
You've grown into a young lady.

206
08:37.000 --> 08:37.669
Yes.

207
08:37.909 --> 08:40.570
You're working in administration at the plant?

208
08:40.850 --> 08:42.210
I studied accounting,

209
08:42.240 --> 08:44.130
but when I got into the plant,

210
08:44.240 --> 08:46.240
there were no vacancies in the finance department,

211
08:46.240 --> 08:47.960
so I worked at the grassroots level for 3 years.

212
08:47.960 --> 08:49.000
I just passed the exam

213
08:49.000 --> 08:50.740
for Certified Public Accountant.

214
08:50.740 --> 08:51.860
In our plant,

215
08:52.240 --> 08:54.240
there are only two CPAs.

216
08:54.450 --> 08:55.730
That speaks volumes

217
08:55.760 --> 08:57.360
about your ability to learn.

218
08:57.480 --> 08:58.270
Yes.

219
08:58.600 --> 08:59.730
But for accounting,

220
08:59.790 --> 09:01.420
practical experience is the most important.

221
09:01.420 --> 09:02.720
You're right, Director Wan.

222
09:02.720 --> 09:03.730
I wanted

223
09:03.760 --> 09:05.620
to put theory into practice, too.

224
09:05.720 --> 09:07.420
I wrote a practice report.

225
09:07.450 --> 09:09.320
I wonder if you could take a look.

226
09:09.480 --> 09:10.790
Sure.

227
09:12.320 --> 09:14.320
Sorry, I forgot my reading glasses.

228
09:14.400 --> 09:15.950
The title is...

229
09:16.400 --> 09:17.880
Finance Digitalization Reform Plan

230
09:17.880 --> 09:19.390
for the Supply Department.

231
09:19.390 --> 09:20.330
Director Wan,

232
09:20.660 --> 09:21.900
if Ying gets in,

233
09:21.920 --> 09:23.660
we'll have one of our own

234
09:23.690 --> 09:24.820
established there.

235
09:25.000 --> 09:25.780
If there's any news,

236
09:25.780 --> 09:27.310
we'll know it immediately.

237
09:27.480 --> 09:28.510
Of course.

238
09:37.440 --> 09:38.500
Sun Jie.

239
09:39.000 --> 09:39.350
Well,

240
09:39.370 --> 09:40.170
come to my office

241
09:40.170 --> 09:41.270
in half an hour,

242
09:41.750 --> 09:42.360
okay?

243
09:44.580 --> 09:46.460
What's with that look?

244
09:49.440 --> 09:50.020
This family

245
09:50.020 --> 09:51.240
really has it rough.

246
09:52.070 --> 09:53.330
You did the right thing

247
09:54.480 --> 09:55.810
giving them that money.

248
09:56.170 --> 09:57.290
Tell me more.

249
09:59.400 --> 10:00.220
There's a family portrait

250
10:00.220 --> 10:01.580
hanging in their house.

251
10:02.310 --> 10:03.820
The old man is in a wheelchair.

252
10:03.820 --> 10:04.670
And the kid is holding an

253
10:04.670 --> 10:05.730
admission letter.

254
10:06.340 --> 10:07.770
He was admitted in 1995,

255
10:07.770 --> 10:09.770
so he would be a sophomore this year.

256
10:10.090 --> 10:12.000
Their place was blown up like this.

257
10:12.000 --> 10:13.610
It's only normal

258
10:13.630 --> 10:15.090
that they want more money.

259
10:17.120 --> 10:18.240
Not bad.

260
10:18.820 --> 10:19.680
Anything else?

261
10:20.130 --> 10:20.940
Yes.

262
10:22.730 --> 10:23.730
That guy just now

263
10:23.840 --> 10:25.630
looks like a construction worker.

264
10:25.630 --> 10:26.820
He was wearing camouflage,

265
10:26.820 --> 10:28.050
and there was a toolbox

266
10:28.050 --> 10:28.970
in the corner.

267
10:31.130 --> 10:31.820
Look, their house

268
10:31.820 --> 10:33.250
was blown up like this.

269
10:33.450 --> 10:34.510
It'll take at least

270
10:34.850 --> 10:36.340
half a month to fix it.

271
10:37.220 --> 10:37.770
Dad.

272
10:37.940 --> 10:38.610
Did the money

273
10:38.610 --> 10:40.150
you gave them just now

274
10:40.420 --> 10:41.700
include their loss

275
10:41.720 --> 10:43.080
from stopping work?

276
10:45.540 --> 10:46.340
Shan.

277
10:47.220 --> 10:48.090
If you were this observant

278
10:48.090 --> 10:49.610
at home,

279
10:49.770 --> 10:50.730
your mom and I wouldn't have to

280
10:50.730 --> 10:51.940
worry so much.

281
10:52.730 --> 10:53.590
Anything else?

282
10:54.850 --> 10:55.730
One more thing.

283
10:57.090 --> 10:58.060
Dad, shouldn't you

284
10:58.060 --> 10:58.890
wash your clothes?

285
10:58.890 --> 11:00.690
They smell terrible.

286
11:00.710 --> 11:02.350
That's what being a man smells like.

287
11:02.350 --> 11:03.150
When you join the construction team,

288
11:03.150 --> 11:04.680
you'll smell worse than me.

289
11:13.300 --> 11:14.110
Well written.

290
11:14.940 --> 11:15.750
I definitely

291
11:16.300 --> 11:17.390
want to hire her.

292
11:19.110 --> 11:19.900
Kid.

293
11:20.660 --> 11:22.020
Your boss has put in a good word for you.

294
11:22.020 --> 11:23.230
You can relax now.

295
11:23.350 --> 11:24.470
Thank you, Director Wan.

296
11:24.470 --> 11:26.330
Thank you, Department Chief Sun.

297
11:26.550 --> 11:27.830
Sun Jie,

298
11:27.630 --> 11:33.310
[Gentle Breezes, Clear Skies]

299
11:27.850 --> 11:29.860
take Xiaoying to get the paperwork done first.

300
11:29.860 --> 11:30.170
Okay.

301
11:30.170 --> 11:30.760
Alright?

302
11:30.820 --> 11:31.350
Sure.

303
11:31.350 --> 11:32.110
Wenying.

304
11:32.470 --> 11:33.470
Stay for a moment.

305
11:34.700 --> 11:35.700
Goodbye, Director Wan.

306
11:35.700 --> 11:36.830
Goodbye. Off you go.

307
11:39.630 --> 11:40.320
Sit here.

308
11:44.990 --> 11:46.420
Take this back.

309
11:46.520 --> 11:47.200
No, no, no.

310
11:47.300 --> 11:49.060
She's like my own kid. Come on.

311
11:49.060 --> 11:49.860
Director Wan,

312
11:49.920 --> 11:51.470
I can't keep owing you favors.

313
11:51.470 --> 11:52.420
How about this?

314
11:52.550 --> 11:54.020
Please pass this

315
11:54.300 --> 11:55.700
to Department Chief Sun.

316
11:57.860 --> 11:58.660
All right.

317
12:00.540 --> 12:01.830
Things are tense right now.

318
12:01.830 --> 12:03.760
Are there any mistakes on your end?

319
12:04.240 --> 12:05.420
Don't worry.

320
12:05.450 --> 12:07.260
I've arranged everything.

321
12:14.300 --> 12:14.900
Boss.

322
12:15.590 --> 12:16.390
Come and look.

323
12:18.900 --> 12:19.390
I found

324
12:19.390 --> 12:21.060
the critical point of failure.

325
12:21.060 --> 12:21.630
Look.

326
12:23.630 --> 12:24.420
Let me see.

327
12:45.180 --> 12:46.180
That explains it.

328
12:47.190 --> 12:48.390
Look at this flange.

329
12:48.900 --> 12:51.100
It's like it's mixed with glass shards.

330
12:51.150 --> 12:52.350
When the pressure hits,

331
12:52.350 --> 12:53.970
it can cut the sealing layer on the spot,

332
12:53.970 --> 12:55.230
causing an explosion.

333
12:56.060 --> 12:57.110
Not bad, Shan.

334
12:57.300 --> 12:58.110
That's what an education

335
12:58.110 --> 12:58.940
gets you.

336
12:59.350 --> 13:00.180
What's the saying?

337
13:00.180 --> 13:01.990
Like father, like son,

338
13:01.990 --> 13:02.630
right?

339
13:02.630 --> 13:04.740
That's what you call each generation surpassing the last,

340
13:04.740 --> 13:05.670
right, Old Chen?

341
13:08.990 --> 13:09.630
Yiming.

342
13:10.080 --> 13:11.820
Take Shan back first.

343
13:13.600 --> 13:15.260
Hurry up. Don't get in the way.

344
14:05.270 --> 14:10.360
[Received from Wan Yang on July 17...]

345
14:17.060 --> 14:18.350
Keep it on high heat

346
14:18.390 --> 14:19.630
and let the sauce reduce.

347
14:19.630 --> 14:21.020
Once it's thickened, it's ready.

348
14:21.020 --> 14:21.510
Got it?

349
14:21.540 --> 14:22.860
Mom is back.

350
14:27.340 --> 14:28.470
Mom is back.

351
14:28.540 --> 14:29.470
Come and see.

352
14:29.470 --> 14:31.020
Shan is cooking today.

353
14:31.470 --> 14:33.450
See how good he is.

354
14:33.630 --> 14:35.470
Well, this is a surprise!

355
14:35.500 --> 14:37.290
Can't I have my moment for once?

356
14:38.070 --> 14:40.400
Ying's successfully transferred today.

357
14:40.420 --> 14:41.940
And Mom worked hard to support her.

358
14:41.940 --> 14:43.090
Let us men hold down

359
14:43.110 --> 14:45.190
the fort in the kitchen.

360
14:45.870 --> 14:46.630
Take Mom to rest.

361
14:46.630 --> 14:47.060
Take Mom to rest.

362
14:47.060 --> 14:47.700
Okay.

363
14:47.750 --> 14:49.060
My son is so sensible.

364
14:49.060 --> 14:49.960
And my daughter is excellent, too.

365
14:49.960 --> 14:50.820
Today is a good day.

366
14:50.820 --> 14:51.700
Add another dish for me

367
14:51.700 --> 14:52.420
to celebrate.

368
14:52.420 --> 14:53.340
No problem.

369
14:53.510 --> 14:54.390
Mom, go rest.

370
14:54.390 --> 14:55.420
Leave this to us.

371
14:55.450 --> 14:56.330
Okay.

372
14:58.540 --> 14:59.150
Alright.

373
14:59.150 --> 15:00.110
That's enough acting. You can go now.

374
15:00.110 --> 15:00.900
Really.

375
15:00.990 --> 15:01.780
Ying,

376
15:02.270 --> 15:03.820
Mom is so happy today.

377
15:03.820 --> 15:05.350
Should I just tell her?

378
15:05.870 --> 15:06.930
You can't tell her.

379
15:06.940 --> 15:08.260
What if Dad disagrees?

380
15:08.940 --> 15:10.470
Just sneak out tomorrow.

381
15:10.470 --> 15:11.180
I've already

382
15:11.180 --> 15:12.420
packed your things

383
15:12.540 --> 15:13.990
and put them under the bed.

384
15:13.990 --> 15:14.780
Okay.

385
15:14.930 --> 15:16.170
I'll listen to you.

386
15:18.680 --> 15:19.910
Chen is back.

387
15:28.300 --> 15:29.020
You're back.

388
15:29.020 --> 15:29.990
Go take a look.

389
15:29.990 --> 15:31.270
Our son is cooking in the kitchen.

390
15:31.270 --> 15:31.590
Wenying.

391
15:31.590 --> 15:32.470
Dad is back.

392
15:36.470 --> 15:38.800
Come with me. I have something to tell you.

393
15:51.820 --> 15:52.630
Wenying.

394
15:53.020 --> 15:54.420
Tell me the truth.

395
15:54.820 --> 15:55.590
Did your design department

396
15:55.590 --> 15:57.180
check the construction materials

397
15:57.180 --> 15:58.940
against the blueprints?

398
16:01.270 --> 16:02.780
The alloy steel flanges for Project 713,

399
16:02.780 --> 16:04.300
which cost hundreds of yuan,

400
16:04.300 --> 16:05.660
were replaced with

401
16:05.900 --> 16:07.020
these carbon steel ones

402
16:07.020 --> 16:09.020
that cost seven or eight yuan.

403
16:09.020 --> 16:10.050
Does your design department

404
16:10.050 --> 16:11.710
have anything to do with this?

405
16:12.870 --> 16:14.350
What do you mean?

406
16:15.420 --> 16:16.440
What do I mean?

407
16:16.750 --> 16:18.300
It's a pipeline over 200 kilometers.

408
16:18.300 --> 16:19.470
If something goes wrong,

409
16:19.470 --> 16:20.900
how many people will die?

410
16:20.900 --> 16:22.270
Does it have anything to do with you?

411
16:22.270 --> 16:22.750
No.

412
16:22.750 --> 16:23.780
Why are you suspecting me?

413
16:23.780 --> 16:24.820
I have nothing to do with it.

414
16:24.820 --> 16:25.400
Really?

415
16:25.420 --> 16:27.350
I really have nothing to do with it.

416
16:29.270 --> 16:30.730
That's fine. That's fine.

417
16:31.300 --> 16:32.900
It has nothing to do with you.

418
16:32.990 --> 16:34.300
Everyone on the construction crew works under me.

419
16:34.300 --> 16:35.020
I know how they operate.

420
16:35.020 --> 16:36.350
It has nothing to do with me either.

421
16:36.350 --> 16:37.570
Then it must be

422
16:37.600 --> 16:39.350
Sun Jie from the supply department.

423
16:39.350 --> 16:41.060
He used to be Wan Yang's driver.

424
16:41.060 --> 16:42.180
He was one of Wan Yang's most loyal guys.

425
16:42.180 --> 16:44.470
I suspect there's something fishy going on.

426
16:44.470 --> 16:45.700
Lives are at stake.

427
16:45.820 --> 16:48.480
I have to report this to the higher-ups.

428
16:49.660 --> 16:50.820
Today is a happy day.

429
16:50.820 --> 16:51.990
We have to celebrate for the kids.

430
16:51.990 --> 16:53.390
Don't make trouble for me.

431
16:53.390 --> 16:54.660
Even if the sky falls, we'll talk about it tomorrow.

432
16:54.660 --> 16:55.350
Be good.

433
17:30.660 --> 17:31.390
Hello?

434
17:32.120 --> 17:33.380
Something happened.

435
17:36.830 --> 17:37.500
Mom, Dad.

436
17:40.870 --> 17:41.910
Today

437
17:42.460 --> 17:44.070
is a good day for our family.

438
17:44.510 --> 17:46.010
I don't usually get a chance to speak,

439
17:46.010 --> 17:47.940
but today I want to propose a toast.

440
17:51.500 --> 17:52.500
Is that okay, Dad?

441
17:56.390 --> 17:58.260
Our son is proposing a toast.

442
17:58.260 --> 17:59.390
Good. Good.

443
18:00.110 --> 18:01.110
You haven't eaten yet.

444
18:01.110 --> 18:02.710
Our son is proposing a toast.

445
18:03.700 --> 18:04.700
For the first glass,

446
18:04.700 --> 18:06.030
I want to toast my sister.

447
18:06.030 --> 18:07.150
She

448
18:07.260 --> 18:09.460
earned her new position today

449
18:09.460 --> 18:11.070
through her own hard work and smarts.

450
18:11.070 --> 18:11.980
This glass of wine

451
18:11.980 --> 18:14.030
is to wish Ying a bright future.

452
18:14.030 --> 18:15.740
I will always learn from you.

453
18:18.030 --> 18:20.030
Hurry up and get it. Go get it, quick.

454
18:20.900 --> 18:22.590
Mom, don't go.

455
18:22.740 --> 18:23.660
I have another piece of good news

456
18:23.660 --> 18:24.660
that I haven't told you yet.

457
18:24.660 --> 18:25.460
You

458
18:25.790 --> 18:27.600
finally said something sensible.

459
18:27.600 --> 18:30.310
You should have learned from Ying a long time ago.

460
18:30.310 --> 18:31.110
Ying.

461
18:32.030 --> 18:32.830
I

462
18:33.070 --> 18:34.220
always felt

463
18:34.220 --> 18:35.740
that you could do it.

464
18:37.660 --> 18:38.590
Your mom and I

465
18:38.630 --> 18:40.260
picked out a gift for you together.

466
18:40.260 --> 18:41.550
Come, take a look.

467
19:02.150 --> 19:03.070
We know

468
19:03.790 --> 19:05.630
that this watch

469
19:05.660 --> 19:07.350
has a special meaning to you.

470
19:07.660 --> 19:09.030
But you're wearing it

471
19:09.030 --> 19:10.260
every day, running around

472
19:10.260 --> 19:11.660
and knocking it against things.

473
19:11.660 --> 19:13.830
It'd be a shame if it got damaged

474
19:13.830 --> 19:14.980
or lost.

475
19:15.390 --> 19:16.940
So we think

476
19:17.110 --> 19:18.660
you should keep it safe

477
19:18.790 --> 19:20.830
and wear this new one from now on.

478
19:22.070 --> 19:22.830
Take it.

479
19:24.420 --> 19:25.770
-Come on. Try it. -Take it.

480
19:25.770 --> 19:27.010
It's a Seagull watch.

481
19:27.030 --> 19:27.690
Shoo, shoo.

482
19:38.630 --> 19:39.890
Thank you, Mom and Dad.

483
19:40.500 --> 19:41.310
From now on,

484
19:42.790 --> 19:44.110
I'll wear this watch.

485
19:45.310 --> 19:45.900
Good.

486
19:46.150 --> 19:46.940
Dad, Mom,

487
19:46.970 --> 19:48.840
we'd like to propose a toast to you.

488
19:48.840 --> 19:49.490
Okay.

489
19:49.640 --> 19:50.500
Thank you, Dad.

490
19:54.460 --> 19:55.110
Hello?

491
19:59.730 --> 20:00.400
I got it.

492
20:01.180 --> 20:02.310
I'll be right there.

493
20:02.940 --> 20:03.790
What's wrong?

494
20:03.830 --> 20:04.550
Something came up with the team.

495
20:04.550 --> 20:05.590
I have to go there right away.

496
20:05.590 --> 20:07.650
You guys eat first. Don't wait for me.

497
20:09.390 --> 20:10.070
Chen.

498
20:13.070 --> 20:14.260
What's going on?

499
20:25.960 --> 20:27.740
Captain Chen, going out so late?

500
20:27.740 --> 20:28.590
Got something to do.

501
20:28.590 --> 20:30.350
Captain Chen, get in.

502
21:23.530 --> 21:25.420
[Station Entrance]

503
21:25.420 --> 21:27.210
[Waiting Room]

504
21:26.420 --> 21:28.220
Anyone want to stay at the hotel?

505
21:32.940 --> 21:33.500
Ying.

506
21:38.150 --> 21:38.790
Shan.

507
21:41.150 --> 21:42.220
When you're away from home,

508
21:42.220 --> 21:43.590
it's convenient to have a cellphone.

509
21:43.590 --> 21:44.030
No.

510
21:44.030 --> 21:45.070
This is too expensive.

511
21:45.070 --> 21:46.390
I can't take it, Ying.

512
21:46.590 --> 21:47.650
It's second-hand.

513
21:47.900 --> 21:48.870
When I have money in the future,

514
21:48.870 --> 21:50.070
I'll buy you a new one.

515
21:52.630 --> 21:54.550
When I get back from Guangzhou,

516
21:54.550 --> 21:56.350
I'll bring you the latest model.

517
21:57.230 --> 21:57.980
Okay.

518
22:00.070 --> 22:01.000
Thank you, Ying.

519
22:02.550 --> 22:03.310
When you get on the train later,

520
22:03.310 --> 22:04.640
call Dad.

521
22:08.940 --> 22:09.940
Where's the boss?

522
22:10.500 --> 22:11.310
Inside.

523
22:11.390 --> 22:12.150
Out back?

524
22:12.370 --> 22:12.890
Okay.

525
22:16.170 --> 22:16.850
Boss.

526
22:17.940 --> 22:18.630
Boss.

527
22:18.740 --> 22:20.270
I've closed all the valves.

528
22:21.350 --> 22:21.800
Okay.

529
22:22.140 --> 22:24.030
Then tell everyone to get to work.

530
22:24.050 --> 22:24.550
Alright.

531
22:24.550 --> 22:25.390
Be careful.

532
22:27.790 --> 22:28.310
Guys,

533
22:28.310 --> 22:29.570
the valves are closed.

534
22:29.660 --> 22:30.660
Let's get to work.

535
22:45.570 --> 22:47.460
Ying, go back.

536
22:48.560 --> 22:49.240
Got it.

537
23:01.510 --> 23:02.340
Hello, Shan.

538
23:02.940 --> 23:03.940
Don't speak yet.

539
23:04.150 --> 23:05.170
Listen to Dad.

540
23:05.060 --> 23:05.840
[Pressure Gauge]

541
23:05.390 --> 23:07.050
On this construction site...

542
24:33.980 --> 24:35.180
Where's the family? Where's the family?

543
24:35.180 --> 24:36.050
Here.

544
24:36.110 --> 24:37.710
Doctor, you have to save him.

545
24:40.030 --> 24:41.630
-Mom. -Mom.

546
24:42.000 --> 24:43.330
Be careful.

547
24:44.240 --> 24:44.960
Mom.

548
24:44.980 --> 24:46.300
W-Where's Dad?

549
24:46.920 --> 24:47.650
Where's Dad?

550
24:50.600 --> 24:51.330
It's okay.

551
24:57.540 --> 25:00.860
[Red Zone]

552
25:09.000 --> 25:10.680
Dad. Dad.

553
25:11.500 --> 25:12.180
Dad.

554
25:19.940 --> 25:20.700
Dad.

555
25:22.460 --> 25:24.420
Dad, what're you saying? Dad.

556
25:24.420 --> 25:27.880
-Your mom... -Mom!

557
25:28.070 --> 25:30.960
-Mom, Dad is calling you, Mom. -Mom is here.

558
25:31.900 --> 25:32.580
Mom is here.

559
25:32.580 --> 25:34.740
-Mom, Dad is calling you, Mom. -Mom is here.

560
25:34.740 --> 25:35.700
Mom is here. Dad.

561
25:36.830 --> 25:37.980
My dad is still alive.

562
25:37.980 --> 25:38.740
Doctor.

563
25:39.260 --> 25:40.070
My dad is still alive.

564
25:40.070 --> 25:41.070
Please save him.

565
25:41.260 --> 25:41.900
Save him.

566
25:41.900 --> 25:43.420
Dad.

567
25:43.840 --> 25:45.400
Dad.

568
25:45.940 --> 25:46.980
Save my dad.

569
25:47.280 --> 25:48.610
Please save my—

570
25:49.260 --> 25:49.790
Dad.

571
25:52.270 --> 25:52.900
Dad!

572
25:54.850 --> 25:55.780
Dad.

573
25:59.420 --> 26:00.310
Dad!

574
26:02.870 --> 26:04.030
Dad.

575
26:04.740 --> 26:06.420
Dad, wake up. Dad.

576
26:07.390 --> 26:08.180
Dad.

577
26:08.730 --> 26:09.790
Dad.

578
26:10.500 --> 26:11.210
Dad.

579
26:11.270 --> 26:11.800
Dad.

580
26:11.820 --> 26:12.420
Dad.

581
26:14.110 --> 26:15.240
Don't sleep.

582
26:17.630 --> 26:19.350
Dad.

583
26:22.770 --> 26:23.730
Chen.

584
26:29.960 --> 26:31.930
Dad!

585
26:32.990 --> 26:34.360
Dad.

586
26:37.950 --> 26:39.740
Dad.

587
27:39.150 --> 27:39.740
Come see

588
27:39.930 --> 27:40.650
what Daddy

589
27:40.680 --> 27:42.240
brought you!

590
27:42.430 --> 27:43.080
Look.

591
27:43.210 --> 27:43.800
Mom,

592
27:43.830 --> 27:45.590
Dad brought me a gift.

593
27:46.300 --> 27:48.510
This one looks like me, and this one looks like Daddy.

594
27:48.510 --> 27:49.390
What about this one?

595
27:49.390 --> 27:50.550
This one looks like Mom.

596
27:50.550 --> 27:51.890
This one looks like me.

597
27:52.270 --> 27:53.340
Look.

598
27:53.800 --> 27:55.600
Put them together,

599
27:56.260 --> 27:57.690
and that's our whole family,

600
27:57.690 --> 27:58.490
right?

601
27:59.140 --> 27:59.820
Right.

602
28:19.630 --> 28:20.370
Dad.

603
28:28.700 --> 28:31.580
[Wugang Petrochemical Construction Exhibition Hall]

604
28:36.220 --> 28:37.590
Is this the one you want?

605
28:39.030 --> 28:40.290
Do you know how to play?

606
28:40.420 --> 28:41.220
No.

607
28:42.390 --> 28:43.260
When you grow up,

608
28:43.260 --> 28:44.700
Dad will teach you how to play basketball.

609
28:44.700 --> 28:46.500
Then you can play with Dad, okay?

610
28:52.740 --> 28:55.730
[Wugang Petrochemical Construction Exhibition Hall]

611
29:30.310 --> 29:31.110
Is it them?

612
29:31.110 --> 29:32.180
Yes, it's them.

613
29:37.150 --> 29:37.930
[Grave of Chen Fu, Beloved Father]

614
29:37.310 --> 29:38.370
What are you doing?

615
29:38.630 --> 29:39.350
What are you doing?

616
29:39.350 --> 29:40.210
What am I doing?

617
29:41.030 --> 29:42.450
The explosion blinded my brother,

618
29:42.450 --> 29:43.510
and you still ask what I'm doing here?

619
29:43.510 --> 29:44.280
Get lost.

620
29:49.010 --> 29:50.430
What exactly do you want?

621
29:55.790 --> 29:56.900
I'll sue you!

622
29:57.890 --> 29:59.060
Shan!

623
29:59.130 --> 30:00.220
Stop it!

624
30:00.300 --> 30:02.590
-Shan! Shan! -Stop! Shan!

625
30:02.620 --> 30:03.970
What are you doing?

626
30:07.660 --> 30:08.720
What are you doing?

627
30:11.730 --> 30:12.790
Where is Shan?

628
30:27.380 --> 30:28.640
I got all the medicine.

629
30:34.550 --> 30:35.810
Is Mom feeling better?

630
30:37.320 --> 30:39.650
She should be fine once the IV is finished.

631
30:40.660 --> 30:41.700
I ran into Ma Yiming's mom

632
30:41.700 --> 30:43.220
in the hallway just now.

633
30:43.830 --> 30:45.310
You take Mom home first.

634
30:45.330 --> 30:47.120
I'll go check on Yiming.

635
30:47.810 --> 30:48.740
Come back early.

636
31:02.350 --> 31:02.870
Hello.

637
31:02.870 --> 31:03.500
Hello.

638
31:03.640 --> 31:04.750
Could you tell me

639
31:04.870 --> 31:06.630
which ward Ma Yiming is in?

640
31:08.260 --> 31:09.420
Ward 10.

641
31:10.460 --> 31:11.260
Thank you.

642
31:12.930 --> 31:17.660
[Ward 10]

643
31:37.200 --> 31:38.170
Auntie.

644
31:40.180 --> 31:41.590
I came to see Yiming.

645
31:46.420 --> 31:47.810
What did the doctor say

646
31:48.660 --> 31:50.060
about his condition now?

647
31:52.550 --> 31:54.680
The explosion broke three of his ribs,

648
31:55.590 --> 31:56.450
and he suffered

649
31:57.030 --> 31:58.550
burns over his body.

650
31:59.830 --> 32:01.150
He was fine,

651
32:01.280 --> 32:03.550
and then suddenly he ended up like this.

652
32:07.630 --> 32:09.220
When they pulled him out,

653
32:09.830 --> 32:11.630
he was still dazed.

654
32:13.500 --> 32:15.220
He kept repeating

655
32:15.740 --> 32:17.550
"flange, flange."

656
32:18.680 --> 32:20.740
I don't know what he was saying.

657
32:33.310 --> 32:34.350
Mom is asleep.

658
32:37.980 --> 32:38.420
Come.

659
32:51.260 --> 32:51.900
Ying.

660
32:52.500 --> 32:53.150
Today,

661
32:53.150 --> 32:54.680
when I went to see Ma Yiming,

662
32:55.030 --> 32:55.790
I suddenly remembered

663
32:55.790 --> 32:57.940
the day Dad took me to the construction site.

664
32:57.940 --> 32:59.590
He discovered a problem with the flange fragments

665
32:59.590 --> 33:01.450
from the construction pipeline.

666
33:03.030 --> 33:03.980
Dad said,

667
33:03.980 --> 33:05.150
if something goes wrong with a project,

668
33:05.150 --> 33:06.030
three departments

669
33:06.030 --> 33:06.980
are bound to be involved.

670
33:06.980 --> 33:08.310
First, the design department.

671
33:08.310 --> 33:09.640
Your mom's department.

672
33:10.070 --> 33:11.550
Is her blueprint planning

673
33:11.830 --> 33:12.830
reasonable?

674
33:13.500 --> 33:15.110
And are

675
33:15.110 --> 33:16.500
the construction methods

676
33:16.500 --> 33:17.790
suited to the terrain?

677
33:17.900 --> 33:19.050
The supply department.

678
33:19.050 --> 33:20.590
Our materials and equipment

679
33:20.590 --> 33:21.700
are all provided by them.

680
33:21.700 --> 33:23.420
Could there be quality defects

681
33:23.420 --> 33:24.180
and aging?

682
33:24.270 --> 33:25.050
The construction team.

683
33:25.050 --> 33:26.970
Were there any operating errors,

684
33:27.030 --> 33:28.260
improper installation,

685
33:28.260 --> 33:29.180
or violations

686
33:29.260 --> 33:30.700
of safety procedures?

687
33:30.830 --> 33:31.740
Do you remember

688
33:32.150 --> 33:33.550
how distracted Dad was

689
33:33.660 --> 33:35.220
when he came home that day?

690
33:35.220 --> 33:36.030
I suggested a toast,

691
33:36.030 --> 33:37.490
but he didn't even hear me.

692
33:38.550 --> 33:39.260
I really think

693
33:39.260 --> 33:41.390
he must have discovered something.

694
33:43.630 --> 33:44.900
Do you think

695
33:46.830 --> 33:48.670
this explosion

696
33:49.590 --> 33:51.150
wasn't an accident at all?

697
33:55.070 --> 33:55.930
How about this?

698
33:56.310 --> 33:57.070
While we're sorting through

699
33:57.070 --> 33:58.460
Dad's belongings over the next couple of days,

700
33:58.460 --> 33:59.590
let's look around

701
33:59.630 --> 34:01.030
and see if we can find

702
34:01.150 --> 34:02.580
the flange fragments.

703
34:02.980 --> 34:03.830
Look.

704
34:03.940 --> 34:06.030
I've been keeping a record

705
34:06.030 --> 34:07.070
ever since I started working.

706
34:07.070 --> 34:07.500
Dad also

707
34:07.500 --> 34:08.889
kept a work notebook.

708
34:09.110 --> 34:10.219
If we find it,

709
34:10.820 --> 34:12.380
there might be clues.

710
34:13.030 --> 34:13.889
How about this?

711
34:14.159 --> 34:16.380
You stay home and take care of Mom tomorrow.

712
34:16.380 --> 34:18.550
I'll go to Dad's office to pack up

713
34:19.150 --> 34:20.699
and see if I can find them.

714
35:38.510 --> 35:39.300
Shan.

715
35:39.990 --> 35:42.250
I know you're going to work in Guangdong.

716
35:42.500 --> 35:43.540
I support you.

717
35:44.030 --> 35:44.780
Go for it.

718
36:13.320 --> 36:16.350
[Safety Management Organizational Chart]

719
36:16.450 --> 36:17.630
[Construction Schedule]

720
36:19.260 --> 36:20.070
Captain He.

721
36:19.850 --> 36:23.710
[Construction Team]

722
36:21.150 --> 36:21.950
Secretary Hu.

723
36:22.030 --> 36:24.180
Director Wan wants you to attend an emergency meeting.

724
36:24.180 --> 36:24.990
Is it urgent?

725
36:25.180 --> 36:25.910
Yes.

726
36:26.380 --> 36:27.030
Let's go then.

727
36:27.030 --> 36:27.660
Let's go.

728
36:28.860 --> 36:30.150
What's the meeting about?

729
36:29.010 --> 36:34.350
[Construction Schedule]

730
36:30.180 --> 36:31.220
It's about the Project 713

731
36:31.220 --> 36:32.470
explosion accident.

732
36:37.370 --> 36:45.210
[Director's Office]

733
36:43.430 --> 36:44.110
Ying?

734
36:46.340 --> 36:47.400
What are you doing?

735
36:48.300 --> 36:48.950
Mr. Qi.

736
36:49.510 --> 36:50.470
I need your help.

737
36:51.660 --> 36:53.990
Then let's go to my office.

738
36:54.550 --> 36:55.210
Let's go.

739
36:55.620 --> 36:57.480
[Director's Office] [Activity Room]

740
36:59.140 --> 37:00.400
Deputy Director Geng.

741
37:01.320 --> 37:02.580
Deputy Director Geng?

742
37:03.070 --> 37:04.330
Deputy Director Geng.

743
37:04.470 --> 37:05.870
There's a tricky problem

744
37:06.430 --> 37:07.910
that only you can resolve.

745
37:06.760 --> 37:12.400
[Infrastructure Department]

746
37:08.510 --> 37:09.420
Hurry, Deputy Director Geng.

747
37:09.420 --> 37:10.190
Okay.

748
37:12.590 --> 37:15.400
[Finance Department]

749
37:16.080 --> 37:16.870
What's wrong?

750
37:16.870 --> 37:18.130
Deputy Director Geng.

751
37:18.170 --> 37:19.230
I'm busy right now.

752
37:26.870 --> 37:33.400
[Director's Office] [Activity Room

753
37:28.720 --> 37:29.980
Deputy Director Geng.

754
37:29.990 --> 37:32.000
-It's tricky. Hurry up. -Okay, okay.

755
37:32.000 --> 37:32.890
My back.

756
37:36.070 --> 37:37.780
Secretary Hu called He Jianchuan

757
37:37.780 --> 37:38.990
in for the Project 713

758
37:38.990 --> 37:40.180
accident meeting?

759
37:42.700 --> 37:44.200
Usually, for this kind of meeting,

760
37:44.200 --> 37:46.110
they would notify the technical staff

761
37:46.110 --> 37:47.590
and the family of the deceased.

762
37:47.590 --> 37:49.320
But neither of us was notified.

763
37:49.740 --> 37:51.180
This is a bit strange.

764
37:52.430 --> 37:53.340
Do you think

765
37:54.150 --> 37:55.070
they'll make a decision

766
37:55.070 --> 37:56.820
that goes against our family?

767
38:01.150 --> 38:02.250
Where are they having the meeting?

768
38:02.250 --> 38:03.580
The director's office.

769
38:03.990 --> 38:04.660
I'll go take a look.

770
38:04.660 --> 38:05.380
Mr. Qi,

771
38:06.150 --> 38:07.950
they said it's a secret meeting.

772
38:08.150 --> 38:09.480
Even my mom can't get in.

773
38:09.550 --> 38:11.010
How are you going to get in?

774
38:13.260 --> 38:13.950
I...

775
38:21.770 --> 38:22.620
I have an idea.

776
38:23.590 --> 38:25.150
The city has tasked the municipal regulatory bureau

777
38:25.150 --> 38:27.010
and the Wugang County Government

778
38:27.430 --> 38:30.380
with leading a task force, and the investigation has begun.

779
38:30.380 --> 38:32.430
We need to decide today

780
38:33.110 --> 38:35.040
who bears primary responsibility

781
38:35.130 --> 38:36.730
for the Project 713 accident

782
38:37.150 --> 38:40.260
and Chen Fu's death,

783
38:40.630 --> 38:42.960
so we're prepared for the investigation.

784
39:09.700 --> 39:10.780
The AC is broken.

785
39:11.110 --> 39:11.910
Wait a minute.

786
39:16.860 --> 39:18.180
Send an electric fan

787
39:18.180 --> 39:20.240
to the director's office right away.

788
39:26.700 --> 39:27.820
Ji, come here.

789
39:27.850 --> 39:28.550
Where are you going?

790
39:28.550 --> 39:30.070
The AC in the director's office is broken.

791
39:30.070 --> 39:31.330
I'm bringing him a fan.

792
39:31.860 --> 39:32.510
Well,

793
39:32.660 --> 39:33.740
I need to see the director.

794
39:33.740 --> 39:34.950
Give it to me. I'll take it in for you.

795
39:34.950 --> 39:36.280
Okay. Thank you, Mr. Qi.

796
39:42.910 --> 39:43.700
Why is it you?

797
39:43.700 --> 39:44.590
T-They called me

798
39:44.590 --> 39:46.110
to bring a fan

799
39:46.110 --> 39:47.570
to the director's office.

800
39:47.700 --> 39:49.150
Okay, come in.

801
39:53.590 --> 39:54.390
Director Wan,

802
39:54.820 --> 39:56.480
you're having a meeting here?

803
39:56.800 --> 39:57.330
Then I...

804
40:14.070 --> 40:14.740
Hello?

805
40:16.510 --> 40:17.510
Wrong number.

806
40:17.630 --> 40:19.300
This is not the finance department.

807
40:19.300 --> 40:20.100
Wrong number.

808
40:28.550 --> 40:30.420
Director Wan, is this speed okay?

809
40:30.910 --> 40:31.780
You guys continue your meeting.

810
40:31.780 --> 40:32.910
I'll head out first.

811
40:45.030 --> 40:47.370
Our plant is at a critical point right now.

812
40:47.740 --> 40:49.800
We need to quickly reach a conclusion

813
40:49.950 --> 40:51.610
on Chen Fu's accidental death

814
40:52.740 --> 40:54.340
in the Project 713 incident,

815
40:55.920 --> 40:57.660
hold a plant-wide meeting,

816
40:58.420 --> 41:00.630
and get our story straight for the public.

817
41:00.630 --> 41:02.160
Director, please go ahead.

818
41:02.740 --> 41:04.260
The design was sound,

819
41:04.300 --> 41:07.180
and there were no problems with the construction equipment or materials.

820
41:07.180 --> 41:09.610
So the problem must have been with the way the work was carried out.

821
41:09.610 --> 41:11.290
In all my years of experience,

822
41:11.470 --> 41:12.660
Chen Fu

823
41:12.740 --> 41:13.910
was a stubborn man

824
41:14.030 --> 41:16.910
who always had his own ideas and refused to listen to others.

825
41:16.910 --> 41:17.910
So

826
41:18.380 --> 41:19.470
Chen Fu should be held

827
41:19.470 --> 41:21.110
fully responsible for the accident.
